Fork (retroeki) changes to the in-tree Wine VBScript engine (standalone/inc/wine),
saved when merging upstream vpinball/vpinball master (ea85e57f8) on 2026-09-28.

Upstream replaced the in-tree Wine sources with the external vpinball/libwinevbs
(pinned via LIBWINEVBS_SHA in platforms/config.sh, Wine 11.17 at the time of the
merge), so these fork changes are no longer built. Port them to a libwinevbs fork
if still needed.

Contents:
  Part 1 - fork changes already present in the initial snapshot 75e15dfb1,
           relative to upstream 10acd90d3 (Wine 10.19 era; parser.output omitted).
  Part 2 - later fork commits touching the in-tree Wine sources, one patch per
           commit. The 10.19 -> 11.8 upgrade commit 83bfd53ce is omitted because
           libwinevbs is already on a newer Wine.

Also removed in this merge: RenderDevice.cpp's use of vbs_get_last_member_assign()
(defined in the fork's interp.c) is now stubbed; see Part 2 commit 12d716901.

