Subject: [PATCH] Wine vbscript: gate redefined/CreateObject info logs behind
 EXTERNAL_LOG_DIAG

Switches the noisy "name redefined" and CreateObject() info lines from
external_log_info to EXTERNAL_LOG_DIAG so they only fire when
VPX_SCRIPT_DIAG=1, matching the rest of the script-diag logging.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
